<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty up at 3.0030 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty up at 3.0030 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0030 against the dollar, up from 3.0120 yesterday and at 1.8295 against the mark, down from 1.8220, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty at an average of 2.40 percent from a weighted central dollar and mark parity rates, up from Tuesday's 2.35 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
